    "Drive, in Quick Controls, sets a self-timer of 3 or 10 seconds, or a burst. VoiceOver says each second of the countdown.": {
      "comment": "Accessibility screen: the self-timer and burst. A burst is a rapid run of separate photos. Drive is the name of the camera's quick control for the self-timer and burst; Quick Controls is the row of camera toggles. VoiceOver is Apple's screen reader; keep the name unchanged.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Aufnahmemodus in den Schnellsteuerungen stellt einen Selbstauslöser von 3 oder 10 Sekunden oder eine Serie ein. VoiceOver sagt jede Sekunde des Countdowns an."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Disparo, en los controles rápidos, ajusta un temporizador de 3 o 10 segundos, o una ráfaga. VoiceOver dice cada segundo de la cuenta atrás."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Mode de prise, dans les commandes rapides, règle un retardateur de 3 ou 10 secondes, ou une rafale. VoiceOver annonce chaque seconde du compte à rebours."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Scatto, nei controlli rapidi, imposta un autoscatto di 3 o 10 secondi, o una raffica. VoiceOver pronuncia ogni secondo del conto alla rovescia."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "クイックコントロールの「ドライブ」で、3秒または10秒のセルフタイマー、またはバーストを設定できます。VoiceOverがカウントダウンを1秒ずつ読み上げます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "빠른 제어의 드라이브에서 3초 또는 10초 셀프 타이머나 연속 촬영을 설정할 수 있습니다. VoiceOver가 카운트다운을 1초마다 읽어 줍니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Opnamemodus, in Snelle bediening, stelt een zelfontspanner van 3 of 10 seconden of een burst in. VoiceOver zegt elke seconde van het aftellen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Disparo, nos Controles Rápidos, define um temporizador de 3 ou 10 segundos, ou uma sequência. O VoiceOver fala cada segundo da contagem regressiva."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "快捷控制中的“驱动”可设置 3 秒或 10 秒的自拍定时或连拍。VoiceOver 会读出倒计时的每一秒。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "快速控制中的「驅動」可設定 3 秒或 10 秒的自拍定時或連拍。VoiceOver 會讀出倒數的每一秒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
